 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "Here is what company policy says. Parental leave (POL-PAR-01): Birth, adoptive and foster parents with at least 6 months of service get 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave, taken within 12 months of the child's arrival. Employees with less than 6 months of service get 6 weeks paid. Tell HR at least 30 days before the leave starts when possible.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-PAR-01"
 ]
